WEBVTT

01:36.800 --> 01:37.920
It is only right to apologize

01:39.400 --> 01:40.480
when you are at fault.

01:43.400 --> 01:45.120
You don't have to dwell on it, Mr. Yang.

01:46.200 --> 01:48.040
I lived in Yizhou for over ten years.

01:48.120 --> 01:49.680
I am used to it.

01:51.000 --> 01:53.160
Mr. Yang,
if you truly regret your actions,

01:53.240 --> 01:55.680
you should treat the Ji family
more favorably moving forward.

01:57.000 --> 01:58.680
I'd better hurry back to dye the silk.

01:59.480 --> 02:00.600
Wait a minute.

02:04.360 --> 02:05.520
Since I'm here to apologize,

02:06.800 --> 02:08.160
I must show some sincerity.

02:11.560 --> 02:12.480
What is this?

02:16.720 --> 02:17.880
There is nothing on it.

02:34.040 --> 02:34.880
What is this?

02:38.440 --> 02:39.320
A gift from you?

02:41.840 --> 02:42.840
What kind of dye did you use?

02:44.000 --> 02:45.240
How could you tell I used dye?

02:45.320 --> 02:47.760
Well, I wouldn't be bothered
if you showed me something else.

02:49.280 --> 02:53.160
So, do you want a favor,
or do you want this instead?

02:58.040 --> 03:00.360
Why are you so insincere?

03:00.440 --> 03:02.320
If you're going to apologize,
then do it properly!

03:03.040 --> 03:04.160
Why are you making her choose?

03:05.400 --> 03:06.520
You're right, Linglong.

03:41.560 --> 03:43.120
Mr. Jiang,

03:43.200 --> 03:46.240
your wife just called you home for dinner.

03:46.320 --> 03:47.840
Alas, don't rush me!

03:47.920 --> 03:49.640
Good work takes time!

03:58.840 --> 04:00.840
It's time for some flower cookies.

04:06.400 --> 04:07.560
Ms. Ji,

04:08.080 --> 04:09.880
my madam requested to meet you.

04:12.000 --> 04:13.240
Your madam is…?

04:13.320 --> 04:15.760
The daughter of General Niu, Ms. Niu.

04:18.880 --> 04:20.800
I've never had any dealings
with your madam.

04:20.880 --> 04:21.839
Why would she want to meet me?

04:23.400 --> 04:26.080
My madam saw the velvet flowers
you presented at the Splendor Showcase,

04:26.160 --> 04:27.000
and she adored them.

04:27.720 --> 04:30.440
She is asking if you could replicate them

04:30.520 --> 04:31.960
using the flowers she grows.

04:32.040 --> 04:34.200
Can you… accept the order?

04:36.720 --> 04:40.240
Well… I'll have to take a look
at the flowers first.

05:34.560 --> 05:36.080
- After them!
- Yes, sir!

05:38.120 --> 05:39.600
- What happened?
- As per your orders,

05:39.680 --> 05:42.080
we had been scouting the cave for days.
Nothing happened at all.

05:42.160 --> 05:45.160
But a group of people suddenly
showed up today and ambushed us.

05:48.600 --> 05:51.960
THE NIU RESIDENCE

06:09.640 --> 06:12.240
Ms. Niu, Ms. Ji has arrived.

06:13.680 --> 06:14.840
Greetings, Ms. Niu.

06:16.120 --> 06:18.480
Ms. Ji, it's good to see you again.

06:19.680 --> 06:20.720
Please, sit.

06:34.000 --> 06:36.800
I've actually wanted
to meet you for a long time.

06:37.960 --> 06:41.800
I'm merely a commoner who happened
to cross paths with you once.

06:41.880 --> 06:43.560
How did you come to know of me?

06:44.840 --> 06:47.720
Falling flowers filled the sky
during the Splendor Showcase,

06:47.800 --> 06:49.840
and Flushed Rose stunned the whole crowd.

06:50.760 --> 06:54.560
Who in Yizhou hasn't heard of you?

06:59.680 --> 07:02.240
Actually, Ms. Ji, I admire you greatly.

07:02.320 --> 07:03.800
You admire me?

07:04.480 --> 07:06.120
Ms. Niu, you come from
a distinguished background.

07:06.200 --> 07:08.040
What's there to envy about me?

07:11.800 --> 07:14.120
Ms. Ji, I want to be like you.

07:15.040 --> 07:17.680
I want to build a career as a woman

07:18.480 --> 07:20.800
and prove to my father
that a woman's future

07:20.880 --> 07:23.920
is not only limited to marriage.

07:26.920 --> 07:28.280
Ms. Niu, you certainly are ambitious.

07:31.240 --> 07:33.360
I'm sure you will achieve
whatever you set your heart on.

07:43.600 --> 07:44.720
What a fine tea.

07:46.320 --> 07:47.280
Ms. Ji,

07:47.360 --> 07:51.440
would you be interested in joining me
to oversee the brocade business in Yizhou?

07:58.960 --> 08:02.480
I know that you and Mr. Zhao are in love,

08:03.360 --> 08:04.560
but the Zhao family opposes it.

08:05.800 --> 08:08.920
I can help you
secure your marriage with him…

08:12.320 --> 08:14.200
And restore the Ji family's prestige

08:14.280 --> 08:17.680
from your father's era.

08:39.039 --> 08:42.080
Ms. Niu, with all
your wealth and influence,

08:42.760 --> 08:46.400
why would you lower yourself
to pursue a career?

08:46.480 --> 08:49.160
Merchants are considered
the lowest of society.

08:49.240 --> 08:52.320
Ms. Niu, I truly find it hard
to believe your words.

08:53.680 --> 08:56.080
Ms. Ji, you're a very cautious person.

08:56.680 --> 08:57.760
Very well.

08:58.320 --> 09:02.480
Let me show you why I want this.

09:22.960 --> 09:25.360
- This is…?
- My mother.

09:27.240 --> 09:29.800
My mother was only 16
when she married into this family

09:30.320 --> 09:32.120
and bore five children for my father.

09:33.480 --> 09:35.560
However, my father only desired a son

09:35.640 --> 09:37.400
who could fight alongside him.

09:38.520 --> 09:39.600
Sadly,

09:39.680 --> 09:42.080
after five attempts,
all he had were daughters.

09:43.840 --> 09:45.920
When I was born,
my mother's health deteriorated,

09:46.520 --> 09:48.160
and she could no longer bear children.

09:49.240 --> 09:51.200
She never left the house ever since.

09:51.280 --> 09:55.600
General, when will you return?

09:58.040 --> 09:59.160
Mrs. Niu…

09:59.760 --> 10:01.000
She doesn't recognize me either.

10:02.280 --> 10:03.400
General…

10:03.480 --> 10:04.680
Now, she has become a woman

10:04.760 --> 10:07.200
who only spends her days
waiting for her husband's return.

10:10.920 --> 10:14.240
My father married off
all four of my sisters

10:15.280 --> 10:17.680
to men who could help him gain more power.

10:19.280 --> 10:21.080
I, too, have been married twice,

10:21.800 --> 10:22.920
but I won't accept my fate.

10:23.960 --> 10:26.920
Since women can't be officials,
I'll venture into business.

10:27.560 --> 10:29.520
I'll show my father that

10:30.120 --> 10:33.760
I'm better than any man he chooses for me.

10:35.600 --> 10:38.480
Ms. Niu, you sure are ambitious.
I truly admire you.

10:41.800 --> 10:45.680
Bloom Society and Flushed Rose
have proved your worth.

10:47.120 --> 10:48.520
Join me,

10:48.600 --> 10:50.640
and you can reach even greater heights.

10:51.240 --> 10:55.360
Together, we can take full control
of Yizhou's brocade business.

10:58.440 --> 11:00.440
Ms. Niu, you drive a tempting offer,

11:01.200 --> 11:03.520
and I appreciate your honesty.

11:04.320 --> 11:05.720
However, I believe that

11:05.800 --> 11:07.680
personal feelings should
never be mixed with business.

11:08.400 --> 11:12.120
My feelings for Mr. Zhao
cannot be used as a bargaining chip.

11:12.200 --> 11:14.120
Besides, I founded Bloom Society

11:14.200 --> 11:16.360
to give people like Ms. Zhu and myself,

11:16.440 --> 11:18.680
who have no status or power,
a way forward.

11:19.280 --> 11:21.080
If I were to join forces with you,

11:21.160 --> 11:24.200
I would be no different from Mrs. Hua.

11:24.280 --> 11:26.960
For that reason,
I must decline your offer.

11:30.720 --> 11:32.120
As I have said,

11:32.200 --> 11:36.480
Ms. Ji, you still don't grasp
what it is like to hold true power.

11:39.720 --> 11:41.440
True power

11:42.080 --> 11:44.560
is the ability to prevent you
from succeeding in anything

11:45.080 --> 11:46.760
that goes against my will.

11:53.520 --> 11:55.080
FLUSHED ROSE

11:58.000 --> 11:59.000
JI YINGYING FROM YIZHOU'S SANDAOYAN
DYEHOUSE CREATED A NEW COLOR, FLUSHED ROSE

11:59.080 --> 12:00.040
IS APPROVED FOR SALE BY THE OFFICER
OF THE WEAVING AND DYEING BUREAU

12:01.400 --> 12:03.960
Shouldn't this registration document
be on its way to Chang'an?

12:05.960 --> 12:07.600
No wonder Mrs. Hua insisted

12:07.680 --> 12:10.400
I take on
the Flushed Rose orders that day.

12:10.920 --> 12:12.240
Turns out there was
more to it than I thought.

12:13.760 --> 12:16.720
Ms. Niu, you must be the rumored
benefactor behind the Hua family.

12:18.920 --> 12:20.080
That doesn't matter.

12:21.120 --> 12:22.320
The real question is,

12:22.400 --> 12:25.560
will you reconsider your decision?

12:30.120 --> 12:31.360
I have made up my mind.

12:31.440 --> 12:33.280
Thank you for your kindness, Ms. Niu.

12:33.360 --> 12:35.520
It's getting late. I'll take my leave now.

12:42.920 --> 12:44.160
Ms. Ji, please wait.

12:44.680 --> 12:46.760
What are you doing? Let go!

12:46.840 --> 12:47.920
Let go of me!

13:05.400 --> 13:07.680
Ms. Ji, I gave you a chance.

13:12.440 --> 13:14.960
Ms. Niu, your actions right now
only prove that

13:15.040 --> 13:16.760
I was right to reject your offer.

13:18.160 --> 13:20.760
If you refuse to work with me,
then you'll serve me instead.

13:23.000 --> 13:25.160
Ms. Ji, you can only leave this place

13:25.880 --> 13:28.880
once you've dyed the Shu Red Silk.

13:31.920 --> 13:32.880
Hold on.

13:38.480 --> 13:41.480
It's too late for regrets.

13:42.520 --> 13:43.720
Ms. Niu,

13:44.880 --> 13:47.080
can I send a letter to my family
to let them know I'm safe?

13:47.680 --> 13:49.240
I don't want to worry them.

13:50.320 --> 13:52.160
Besides, I'm sure
you don't want this to escalate either.

13:53.440 --> 13:55.240
I may come from a humble background,

13:55.760 --> 13:58.240
but Mr. Sang is part of our Bloom Society.

14:02.960 --> 14:03.800
Get her a pen and a paper.

14:04.400 --> 14:05.400
Yes, madam.

14:20.560 --> 14:22.680
Ms. Niu, she is done.

14:28.160 --> 14:30.600
"Yaoting, Mother, I have learned that

14:30.680 --> 14:33.080
a landslide has happened
300 li outside Yizhou

14:33.720 --> 14:35.200
and delayed the delivery
of the registration document.

14:35.920 --> 14:39.080
I have rented a carriage
to retrieve the document.

14:39.160 --> 14:40.640
Time is tight.

14:40.720 --> 14:42.880
I can't explain in detail.
Please forgive me.

14:43.520 --> 14:44.480
Yaoting, Mother,

14:44.560 --> 14:46.400
remember to buy more ingredients
for the flower cookies and the rest.

14:46.480 --> 14:48.720
We need a lot to produce Flushed Red.

14:48.800 --> 14:51.600
I didn't have enough money
when I bought the dye last time.

14:51.680 --> 14:55.120
Thankfully, Ms. Yu lent me two guan.

14:55.200 --> 14:56.440
Please repay her for me.

14:56.520 --> 14:59.680
Yaoting, Mother, don't worry about me."

15:01.200 --> 15:02.680
Deliver this to the Ji residence later.

15:03.560 --> 15:04.600
Yes.

15:09.480 --> 15:10.520
Keep an eye on her.

15:10.600 --> 15:13.280
If she escapes,
you'll pay for it with your life.

15:13.360 --> 15:14.320
Understood.

15:25.160 --> 15:27.800
These are all materials
for dyeing Shu Red Silk.

15:28.400 --> 15:30.160
Why are they all here?

15:34.240 --> 15:36.080
Why aren't you working? Stop dawdling!

15:36.160 --> 15:37.320
I'm watching you.

15:38.120 --> 15:39.680
These ordinary ingredients won't do

15:39.760 --> 15:42.080
if you want to dye Shu Red Silk.

15:43.920 --> 15:44.960
Then, what else do you need?

15:45.560 --> 15:48.600
I need eight liang of ashes
burned from redwoods,

15:48.680 --> 15:51.040
one jin of madder from the rocks,

15:51.120 --> 15:54.040
and three and a half jin of safflowers
filled with morning dew.

15:56.240 --> 15:57.200
That should be all.

16:01.280 --> 16:02.560
Don't think of playing tricks.

16:04.280 --> 16:05.600
Hurry and get them prepared.

16:05.680 --> 16:07.280
Can you shoulder the blame
if there's a delay in the dyeing process?

16:07.360 --> 16:08.280
You!

16:10.400 --> 16:11.400
Wait here.

16:32.280 --> 16:36.400
Ms. Niu, can Ji Yingying
really dye Shu Red Silk?

16:37.560 --> 16:40.000
If she can dye it, we'll use hers.

16:40.080 --> 16:42.040
If not, we'll use our own.

16:43.400 --> 16:46.320
Mrs. Hua is already ruined,
and Ji Yingying refuses to comply.

16:46.400 --> 16:48.920
Plus, the mountains are unsafe lately.

16:49.880 --> 16:51.600
Even if it's not Yang Jinglan,

16:51.680 --> 16:54.400
someone else is surely targeting us.

16:59.040 --> 17:03.240
The best way to hide a drop of water
is to place it in the sea.

17:04.119 --> 17:06.599
A loom doesn't belong in the mountains,

17:07.560 --> 17:09.680
but if it's placed in a brocade workshop,

17:10.200 --> 17:11.640
no one will suspect a thing.

17:19.200 --> 17:21.560
Ms. Niu,
there is a letter from the General.

17:25.839 --> 17:26.960
You may leave.

17:27.040 --> 17:28.119
Yes, Ms. Niu.

17:32.360 --> 17:34.320
- Ms. Niu.
- Read it.

17:34.840 --> 17:36.080
Summarize the important parts for me.

17:36.920 --> 17:37.880
Okay.

17:43.840 --> 17:44.880
THE SIXTH DAY OF YOU MONTH
IS HIS BIRTHDAY.

17:44.960 --> 17:46.040
JIANXING AND I WENT TO MEET
YOUR POTENTIAL SUITOR. NIU JIN

17:52.160 --> 17:54.240
The General is attempting
to marry you off again.

17:54.320 --> 17:56.320
It's a distant relative
of the Right Military Commissioner.

17:56.840 --> 17:58.000
He wishes to take you as his concubine.

17:59.040 --> 18:00.040
General…

18:01.320 --> 18:03.560
You're his daughter,
not a gift to be given away!

18:03.640 --> 18:04.840
Quiet down.

18:06.200 --> 18:07.520
This is the Niu residence,

18:08.400 --> 18:09.680
not my home.

18:11.080 --> 18:12.720
I just feel sorry for you, Ms. Niu.

18:16.480 --> 18:19.120
The gentleman Ji Yingying fancies
is from the Zhao family,

18:19.640 --> 18:21.960
the renowned brocade merchants in Yizhou.

18:22.920 --> 18:25.000
The name is Zhao Xiuyuan, I believe?

18:25.720 --> 18:26.800
I think so.

18:27.840 --> 18:31.000
The Zhao family is the perfect sea
to hide the drop of water.

18:36.720 --> 18:40.680
SAN HUA PAVILION

18:41.680 --> 18:43.040
Young masters.

18:43.120 --> 18:44.120
- Mister.
- Mister.

18:44.200 --> 18:45.080
This way, please.

19:02.480 --> 19:04.160
This might be a mistake.

19:04.240 --> 19:05.680
Please pardon me.

19:05.760 --> 19:08.960
You are at the right place.
I was the one who invited you, Mr. Zhao.

19:16.000 --> 19:17.160
And you are?

19:19.000 --> 19:21.440
My father is Niu Jin,
Vice Governor of Yizhou.

19:21.520 --> 19:23.440
I am the fifth daughter in my family.

19:23.520 --> 19:25.000
Surely you've heard of me.

19:27.080 --> 19:28.120
Ms. Niu,

19:28.920 --> 19:30.680
why did you invite me here?

19:31.800 --> 19:34.160
Do you intend to keep standing there
to speak with me?

19:34.840 --> 19:36.280
We're strangers.

19:36.800 --> 19:40.120
For the sake of your honor,
it's best that I remain standing here.

19:41.640 --> 19:43.760
Surely you know about my reputation.

19:43.840 --> 19:46.280
Staying there isn't good for yours.

19:50.000 --> 19:53.680
If there's nothing else,
I'll take my leave.

19:53.760 --> 19:55.200
I'm a friend of Ms. Ji.

19:55.840 --> 19:57.560
She asked me to deliver a message to you.

20:00.560 --> 20:02.320
- Yu Yuan.
- Yes.

20:07.600 --> 20:08.960
Mr. Zhao, please wait a moment.

20:24.800 --> 20:27.400
Ms. Niu,
what business do you have with me?

20:46.480 --> 20:50.760
When people see my face
and learn about my status,

20:51.280 --> 20:52.920
they either fear me,

20:53.800 --> 20:55.840
avoid me, or fawn over me.

20:55.920 --> 21:00.040
But you're the only one
who remains unmoved.

21:01.480 --> 21:03.800
Are you not afraid of me?

21:04.840 --> 21:08.080
I don't judge people by their appearances,
only by their hearts.

21:09.560 --> 21:10.640
Excuse me.

21:11.400 --> 21:14.360
Don't you want to hear
the message Ms. Ji left for you?

21:15.480 --> 21:16.480
No.

21:17.280 --> 21:19.800
Yingying would never
entrust someone like you

21:19.880 --> 21:20.720
to deliver a message to me.

21:21.320 --> 21:23.880
What kind of person am I in your eyes?

21:25.040 --> 21:27.360
Calculative and unpredictable.

21:30.400 --> 21:31.600
Alright.

21:31.680 --> 21:34.480
Let me bare my heart to you today.

21:38.320 --> 21:41.680
I fell in love with you at first sight.

21:42.400 --> 21:43.600
I wish for you to accept me.

21:43.680 --> 21:45.440
Careful with what you say.

21:45.960 --> 21:47.480
I am already engaged.

21:48.000 --> 21:50.000
I'm afraid I cannot reciprocate
your affections.

21:51.960 --> 21:53.760
- Is it Ms. Ji from Huanhua Dyehouse?
- Please don't come any closer.

21:57.960 --> 21:59.240
But I have heard that

21:59.320 --> 22:00.720
the Zhao family has already
annulled the engagement.

22:00.800 --> 22:03.720
Even so, I only wish
to marry Yingying in this life.

22:04.960 --> 22:07.360
Please don't make it difficult for me.

22:08.760 --> 22:12.360
Mr. Zhao,
do you realize the weight of my words?

22:13.640 --> 22:15.320
I am the daughter of Niu Jin.

22:15.920 --> 22:19.960
There is nothing
I cannot achieve in Yizhou.

22:20.600 --> 22:22.600
Everyone knows the power of General Niu.

22:23.120 --> 22:24.400
But I truly seek nothing.

22:25.360 --> 22:27.360
If there's nothing else today,

22:27.440 --> 22:30.800
then thank you for the hospitality.

22:31.320 --> 22:32.480
I'll take my leave.

22:53.480 --> 22:56.120
Ms. Niu, Mr. Zhao Senior
will soon hear about you

22:56.200 --> 22:59.160
reserving the entire San Hua Pavilion
just to meet Mr. Zhao.

23:00.320 --> 23:03.760
But will the Zhao family
really take action?

23:05.480 --> 23:07.400
Mr. Zhao Senior is a wise man.

23:07.480 --> 23:08.880
He will understand.

23:08.960 --> 23:10.040
But Ms. Niu,

23:10.120 --> 23:11.920
is Mr. Zhao really
the one you want to choose?

23:21.080 --> 23:22.600
You think he is unsuitable?

23:25.840 --> 23:29.080
He remained unfazed even after
learning about my identity.

23:29.160 --> 23:31.840
He showed neither shock nor disdain
upon seeing my face.

23:32.360 --> 23:34.680
Just for that alone,
he stands above the rest.

23:34.760 --> 23:37.040
But his heart
already belongs to Ji Yingying.

23:37.120 --> 23:38.880
He will never truly love you.

23:38.960 --> 23:40.080
Love?

23:41.120 --> 23:42.640
Do you think I need something like that?

23:45.440 --> 23:48.760
Rather than letting my father marry me off
to some random household,

23:49.280 --> 23:51.120
I'd rather act first.

23:52.480 --> 23:55.000
The Zhao family is one I can control,

23:55.080 --> 23:56.920
and one I urgently need to control.

23:58.360 --> 23:59.800
The Zhao family

23:59.880 --> 24:01.880
is the perfect place
to hide that drop of water.

24:02.920 --> 24:04.480
With the Zhao family's brocade workshop,

24:04.560 --> 24:06.440
I won't need to exhaust myself
weaving brocade in the mountains.

24:12.480 --> 24:16.160
Ji Yingying, since you won't submit to me,

24:16.680 --> 24:18.840
I will just take what you hold dear.

24:28.960 --> 24:31.520
I wonder if Yaoting
has received my letter.

24:39.640 --> 24:41.560
I asked Ms. Yu about it.

24:41.640 --> 24:44.920
She said dyeing Shu Red Silk
doesn't require the things you mentioned.

24:45.000 --> 24:45.920
Are you playing me as a fool?

24:46.000 --> 24:47.840
I'm the one dyeing the silk.
What would she know?

24:47.920 --> 24:49.120
How dare you talk back?

24:49.840 --> 24:52.120
I'm going to teach you a lesson!
Let me teach you a lesson!

24:52.200 --> 24:53.280
You! Still running?

24:54.360 --> 24:56.880
How dare you talk back?
Let's see where you can run.

24:57.640 --> 24:58.720
You!

25:13.200 --> 25:14.840
Why aren't you running?

25:15.480 --> 25:16.760
I'm telling you.

25:16.840 --> 25:18.720
This is just a warning.

25:19.320 --> 25:21.000
If you dare mess with me again,

25:21.080 --> 25:22.760
you won't live to regret it.

25:25.720 --> 25:27.000
Keep an eye on her.

25:43.560 --> 25:46.720
THE ZHAO RESIDENCE

25:46.800 --> 25:47.800
Grandfather.

25:50.760 --> 25:51.800
I heard

25:53.120 --> 25:56.480
Ms. Niu has taken a liking to you.

25:57.000 --> 25:58.480
Grandfather, you must be mistaken.

25:59.200 --> 26:01.800
I only met her briefly by chance.

26:01.880 --> 26:03.000
How could there be any interest?

26:03.680 --> 26:07.320
Is it her disinterest or yours?

26:13.720 --> 26:17.120
You slighted Ms. Niu today.

26:17.200 --> 26:18.600
Did you consider

26:19.920 --> 26:23.120
if she bears a grudge,

26:23.920 --> 26:26.960
Zhao Brocade won't stand a chance

26:27.480 --> 26:29.560
against the Brocade Master?

26:34.000 --> 26:35.040
Grandfather,

26:36.520 --> 26:38.600
Yingying and I are in love.

26:38.680 --> 26:40.800
I cannot accept Ms. Niu's favor.

26:40.880 --> 26:42.160
Foolish boy!

26:43.160 --> 26:45.400
I approved your marriage with Ji Yingying

26:45.480 --> 26:48.600
because of Bloom Society and Flushed Rose.

26:49.280 --> 26:51.680
Your union with her
will help our family greatly.

26:53.520 --> 26:54.760
Xiuyuan,

26:54.840 --> 26:57.120
but if you marry Ms. Niu…

26:59.320 --> 27:00.360
I won't.

27:00.440 --> 27:01.960
How dare you!

27:04.200 --> 27:06.240
A messenger has been sent
to the Niu residence to propose marriage.

27:23.440 --> 27:24.920
Ridiculous!

27:29.200 --> 27:30.400
Grandfather,

27:31.040 --> 27:33.960
she wouldn't want to marry a cripple.

27:34.040 --> 27:36.360
My heart will not change.

27:37.480 --> 27:40.520
Then you'll kneel here
until you have thought it through.

27:40.600 --> 27:41.720
I will kneel.

27:43.320 --> 27:44.640
- I…
- Mr. Zhao Senior!

27:46.400 --> 27:50.200
Here's a message from the Niu residence.
They are inviting Mr. Zhao to visit.

27:54.000 --> 27:56.040
Tell Ms. Niu that

27:56.920 --> 27:59.360
Mr. Zhao will be there.

28:00.200 --> 28:01.240
Yes, sir.

28:14.760 --> 28:18.440
THE NIU RESIDENCE

28:30.320 --> 28:32.320
You look rather worn, Mr. Zhao.

28:33.560 --> 28:35.280
All thanks to you, Ms. Niu.

28:39.440 --> 28:40.920
I have done nothing at all.

28:41.840 --> 28:44.560
It was the Zhao family who came
to my family seeking a marriage proposal.

28:46.400 --> 28:47.760
The Niu family wields tremendous power.

28:48.480 --> 28:50.160
We met at San Hua Pavilion yesterday.

28:51.160 --> 28:54.200
Did you plan all of this in advance?

29:05.600 --> 29:06.440
Please.

29:32.800 --> 29:35.520
Even if you dislike the idea,
you do not show it.

29:36.040 --> 29:37.320
Your composure is admirable, Mr. Zhao.

29:39.080 --> 29:41.680
Earlier, you asked me
if this was intentional.

29:42.520 --> 29:44.520
I pity my sincerity.

29:44.600 --> 29:46.520
You speak of it so disdainfully.

29:47.200 --> 29:48.680
Let's be candid.

29:49.960 --> 29:51.360
You are willing to lower yourself

29:52.200 --> 29:53.720
to marry me, the son of a merchant.

29:54.480 --> 29:55.760
What is your true intention?

29:59.080 --> 30:01.040
Once we are married,

30:01.120 --> 30:03.680
there are certain things
I will share with you.

30:04.640 --> 30:05.760
Who would have thought

30:07.120 --> 30:10.760
you are so desperate
to marry yourself off, Ms. Niu?

30:10.840 --> 30:11.920
How dare you!

30:17.720 --> 30:19.440
Do you know

30:19.520 --> 30:22.720
how I got this scar on my face?

30:27.360 --> 30:31.120
Everyone says I am cursed,
a bringer of bad luck to my husbands.

30:32.240 --> 30:33.320
But in truth,

30:34.600 --> 30:35.840
I wanted them dead.

30:37.040 --> 30:38.760
And so, they died.

30:40.640 --> 30:43.320
This scar was my father's lesson to me.

30:43.840 --> 30:46.880
He was furious at the time,
and his hand slipped.

30:48.200 --> 30:50.160
But I am grateful for this scar.

30:51.360 --> 30:55.480
It earned me the opportunity
to hold power and make decisions.

30:56.800 --> 30:59.520
Power once forced its will upon you.

31:00.280 --> 31:03.040
Now you use it to force
your will on others.

31:05.680 --> 31:07.960
That is the beauty of power.

31:11.520 --> 31:14.560
YUEBUHUAN

31:18.600 --> 31:19.720
Yuniang?

31:20.760 --> 31:23.120
- Yuniang!
- Are you looking for me?

31:23.760 --> 31:25.240
It is Yingying who sent me.

31:25.320 --> 31:27.000
She said when
she bought dye the last time,

31:27.080 --> 31:28.640
she borrowed two guan
but forgot to repay you.

31:29.280 --> 31:31.920
I… I have only managed to earn one guan.

31:33.240 --> 31:34.440
Two guan?

31:35.520 --> 31:37.240
If I am ever in trouble,

31:37.320 --> 31:39.280
I will send you a signal, Yu.

31:39.360 --> 31:40.720
If I say,

31:40.800 --> 31:42.600
I will repay one guan, come and save me.

31:42.680 --> 31:44.360
If I say, I will repay two guan,

31:44.440 --> 31:46.360
bring Mr. Yang with you.

31:47.000 --> 31:49.080
- When did she ask you to come here?
- Yesterday.

31:49.160 --> 31:50.600
Why did you not come yesterday?

31:50.680 --> 31:53.480
I… I was busy collecting the money.

31:54.120 --> 31:55.280
Where is she?

31:56.320 --> 31:59.040
The letter said she went to investigate
the registration document.

32:00.000 --> 32:02.560
A letter? You have not seen her in person?

32:04.000 --> 32:05.760
- Where is the letter?
- The letter?

32:09.200 --> 32:11.000
What had happened, Ms. Yu?

32:11.080 --> 32:12.120
Wait for me outside.

32:15.800 --> 32:18.520
FROM YINGYING

32:21.560 --> 32:22.800
Why should I save you?

32:23.800 --> 32:25.360
Mr. Yang, you love the people
like they are your children.

32:26.200 --> 32:27.800
I do not acknowledge
a rebellious child like you.

32:29.360 --> 32:32.080
If I am in such dire trouble
that I need both of you to save me,

32:32.160 --> 32:35.200
then anything you wanted to know before,

32:35.280 --> 32:37.040
you may ask, and I will answer.

32:38.040 --> 32:40.880
Even if I want to save you,
I need to know where you are.

32:41.520 --> 32:42.760
We have this.

32:55.920 --> 32:58.840
FROM YINGYING

33:02.200 --> 33:03.960
What exactly happened?

33:04.040 --> 33:06.040
Nothing. You should go home.

33:06.120 --> 33:07.440
But Yingying only left
a letter and disappeared.

33:07.520 --> 33:08.680
I am worried about her.

33:08.760 --> 33:10.840
Maybe I should hire a carriage
and go find her.

33:10.920 --> 33:12.880
I will go find her.
You stay home and wait.

33:13.440 --> 33:14.720
No, I will go.

33:16.920 --> 33:18.520
Go home and wait! Trust me.

33:20.160 --> 33:21.240
Alright.

33:26.400 --> 33:28.280
I invited you here today

33:28.360 --> 33:31.320
to enjoy a play with me.

33:32.480 --> 33:33.680
Perhaps after watching,

33:34.200 --> 33:36.160
you will reconsider your decisions.

33:43.080 --> 33:46.600
Ms. Niu said to give you
half an hour to escape.

33:48.040 --> 33:50.520
What kind of new torment is this?

33:50.600 --> 33:51.840
It is a chance to live.

33:51.920 --> 33:53.640
It all depends
on whether you want it or not.

34:19.280 --> 34:20.320
Yingying!

34:34.560 --> 34:35.679
What are you trying to do?

34:35.760 --> 34:37.400
Just inviting you to watch a play.

34:39.199 --> 34:41.040
Best stay away from the windows, Mr. Zhao.

34:41.920 --> 34:44.239
These archers cannot hear sudden noises.

34:45.000 --> 34:48.360
Otherwise, they might shoot at Ms. Ji.

35:00.320 --> 35:01.320
- Ms. Niu!
- Do not move!

35:02.160 --> 35:03.280
Do you believe I will kill you?

35:07.200 --> 35:08.640
A cornered beast fights hardest.

35:09.240 --> 35:11.080
Do you not find it entertaining?

35:16.120 --> 35:18.360
Ms. Ji, your time is running out.

35:18.440 --> 35:19.320
Will you continue?

35:42.840 --> 35:44.080
I really will kill you!

35:47.400 --> 35:50.680
Can you face the consequences
after killing me?

35:51.880 --> 35:56.040
Can the Ji and Zhao families
bear the consequences?

36:10.600 --> 36:13.080
I am sorry.
I will release you once I am outside.

36:14.480 --> 36:17.160
Let me go…!

36:17.800 --> 36:18.640
Do you hear that?

36:18.720 --> 36:19.640
Release her!

36:21.600 --> 36:23.840
What a match made in heaven.

36:24.360 --> 36:27.640
Even your escape plans are identical.

36:28.520 --> 36:29.880
Let me go!

37:16.680 --> 37:17.880
Are you insane?

37:21.720 --> 37:23.720
Mr. Zhao, you clearly
have never killled anyone.

37:25.000 --> 37:26.240
Do you want to kill me?

37:27.320 --> 37:30.160
Should I have them kill a few more

37:30.240 --> 37:32.000
to teach you how it is done?

37:50.080 --> 37:51.640
What exactly are you trying to do?

37:57.560 --> 37:59.200
I have already told you.

38:00.880 --> 38:03.480
From the moment I saw you,
I was captivated.

38:03.560 --> 38:05.480
I wish for us to get married.

38:05.560 --> 38:06.640
I hope you will grant my wish.

38:08.920 --> 38:11.360
MARRIAGE AGREEMENT

38:23.160 --> 38:25.120
Will you release Yingying

38:27.920 --> 38:29.000
if I agree to this?

38:33.280 --> 38:36.920
That depends on whether you are willing

38:37.440 --> 38:40.040
to treat me sincerely
in the future, Mr. Zhao.

39:01.800 --> 39:04.320
How insolent! You dare
cause trouble at the Niu residence!

39:06.440 --> 39:08.000
Hand Yingying over immediately!

39:09.840 --> 39:10.800
Ms. Niu,

39:10.880 --> 39:13.520
there is an urgent decree from the palace.
They want Shu Red Silk.

39:13.600 --> 39:15.160
I have already reported to the governor.

39:15.240 --> 39:17.760
I must take Ji Yingying, the daughter
of the Red Silk Brocade Master,

39:17.840 --> 39:19.320
to assist with the investigation.

39:20.440 --> 39:23.240
Ms. Niu, surrender her at once.

39:26.160 --> 39:28.120
Mr. Yang, you are quite the strategist.

39:28.200 --> 39:29.400
You are not to be underestimated.

39:31.240 --> 39:32.640
But I think you misunderstand, Mr. Yang.

39:33.280 --> 39:37.280
Ms. Ji did visit my residence,
but she has since departed.

39:38.120 --> 39:39.880
Whether she is here or not,

39:40.800 --> 39:41.840
I will know after I search.

39:41.920 --> 39:46.280
The General's residence
is not a place you can search at will.

39:46.360 --> 39:48.200
The emperor's order cannot be defied.

39:48.280 --> 39:49.480
Ms. Niu,

39:50.000 --> 39:51.720
do you intend to resist
an imperial decree?

40:00.200 --> 40:02.120
If you fail to find her,

40:02.800 --> 40:05.360
the crime of forcibly entering
this residence

40:05.440 --> 40:07.440
will not be easily excused.

40:07.520 --> 40:08.560
Fine.

40:09.280 --> 40:11.240
Forgive the intrusion.

40:12.480 --> 40:14.040
- Search everywhere!
- Yes, sir!

40:54.360 --> 40:55.880
Mr. Yang, no sign of her
on the eastern side.

41:02.160 --> 41:03.040
Mr. Yang,

41:04.680 --> 41:06.040
she is not in the backyard either.

41:06.120 --> 41:07.880
- Keep searching!
- Yes, sir.

41:56.200 --> 41:57.800
How dare you act on your own?

41:57.880 --> 41:59.240
ERUDITE AND RESOLUTE IN PURPOSE

41:59.320 --> 42:02.600
Did I not instruct you
to escort Ms. Ji safely back to her house?

42:02.680 --> 42:03.960
How could you do something so foolish?

42:04.040 --> 42:05.400
Please forgive me, miss.

42:05.480 --> 42:07.280
I saw Ms. Ji
behaving arrogantly and rudely,

42:07.360 --> 42:09.080
and I felt indignant.

42:09.160 --> 42:11.080
That is why, in a moment of folly,
I made such a grave mistake.

42:11.160 --> 42:12.560
Please spare me, miss.

42:14.640 --> 42:17.200
Do you realize
if today's event were to spread,

42:17.280 --> 42:18.320
and Ms. Ji's reputation were ruined,

42:18.400 --> 42:19.880
even death would not atone
for your actions?

42:20.680 --> 42:21.960
Enough, Ms. Niu.

42:24.240 --> 42:25.720
This act of pity has gone far enough.

42:27.800 --> 42:30.280
I will not speak of today's event.

42:30.360 --> 42:32.440
Our paths will cross again in the future.
